codex
The RTL distinguishes IRQ/data misalign trap entry from illegal SYSTEM instructions. Ecall/ebreak/unknown opcode are observable as `ex_wb_illegal_r` but do not enter `mtvec`; IRQ/misalign do enter and can produce `mret`. I’m going to add directed stimulus around those actual semantics and merge per-run functional event streams alongside URG vdbs.
