codex
The combined CSR+IRQ program exposed an actual stimulus problem: after IRQ injection the core ran into unknown fetch data and timed out, so the merged CSV contained `x` samples. I’m splitting that into two safer directed tests: one CSR-only terminal test for `csrrw/csrrs/csrrc`, and one known-good IRQ/mret pattern based on the existing lockstep phase.
apply patch
