codex
The `x` rows are not real bin hits: one comes after ecall enters the core’s illegal self-lock behavior, and one is the already-observed IRQ/mret run just before the stop. I’m making the postprocessor skip non-numeric observer rows instead of treating them as stimulus bins; the SV covergroups remain unchanged.
apply patch
