codex
The IRQ run was finishing on the same clock edge as `mret`, before the observer’s CSV write for `mret` landed. I’ll delay that finish by one cycle. I’m also adding a small M-extension directed program for the remaining mul/div op bins, which will push the score beyond 85% by real instruction stimulus.
